{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements.\n\nThe user's interest is: 摄影学习，关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整，不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活。(Photography learning, focusing on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions; NOT interested in equipment promotions or photographers' private lives.)\n\nI need to select exactly 20 distinct candidates from the working set.\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. Each candidate has a title pattern like \"主题：场景中的内容类型\". The content types are:\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - matches interest (成像原理)\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - matches interest (实际拍摄方法)\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - matches interest (学习)\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - about photography exhibitions, curator clues, author biographies, artwork circulation - this is more about art history/private lives, less aligned\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - about camera purchase packages, promotions, celebrity endorsements - this is explicitly NOT wanted (器材促销)\n\nThe interest explicitly says: 不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活 (not interested in equipment promotions or photographers' private lives).\n\nSo I should avoid:\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - equipment promotions\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - about exhibitions, author biographies (摄影师私生活/art history)\n\nI should prefer:\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - imaging principles\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - actual shooting methods\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - learning concepts\n\nLet me identify the candidates that match the interest well. I need 20 candidates.\n\nLet me scan through the candidates and categorize by content type.\n\nContent types in titles:\n- \"条件与原理\" - good match\n- \"操作记录\" - good match\n- \"概念速览\" - good match\n- \"专题观察\" - poor (exhibition/author bio)\n- \"市场观察\" - poor (equipment promo)\n\nLet me collect the good candidates (条件与原理, 操作记录, 概念速览).\n\nLet me go through the list:\n\n1. item-014950ee574d - 静物布光